{
    "title": "Badi \u2013 Rooms & Flats for rent",
    "description": "Download the new generation rental app to find flats and rooms all over Europe.  Thanks to its technology, Badi has already connected more than 6M people with flats and rooms. \r\n\r\n<b>Do you have an apartment or room to rent out? </b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Publish your listing for free in Badi.</b>\r\n\u2022 <b>Receive recommended tenants</b> and visit their profiles. \r\n\u2022 <b>Talk to interested candidates</b> and find a tenant for your apartment thanks to Badi plus. \r\n\r\n<b>Why choose Badi Plus? </b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Unlimited matches</b>: the lister can accept unlimited chat requests from tenants.\r\n\u2022 <b>Direct contact with recommended tenants and listing viewers</b>: listers receive tenants\u2019 recommendations based on their preferences\r\n\u2022 <b>12-hour boost</b>: your listing visibility is improved for 12hrs.\r\n\r\n<b>How to activate Badi Plus*?</b>\r\n\r\n1. You can <b>activate Badi Plus</b> by selecting  \u00abGet Badi plus\u00bb in the \u201cstart\u201d section of the app or the website. \r\n2. In the next step, you will see the benefits, price and duration of the service (30 days).\r\n3. After the payment, <b>Badi Plus</b> will be activated and you can start enjoying it. \r\n4. After getting Badi Plus, you will see a countdown so you\u2019ll always know how long you can benefit from Badi Plus\r\n\r\n<b>*Badi Plus will be activated for one listing and has a duration of 30 days.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Tips and advice</b>: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Making a good first impression is essential when renting a flat or room online. Make sure to upload high-quality and bright photos to convey confidence. We have blog articles that can be of great help to you in the section \u201cHow to use Badi\u201d.\r\n\u2022 A complete profile with a bio and detailed description, a quality profile photo, spoken languages \u200b\u200bincreases the chances of finding an apartment or a room to rent.\r\n\u2022 Use the app's filters to refine your search: sort by price, featured, amenities.\r\n\u2022If you have questions, write to us at info@badi.com and we will be happy to help you.\r\n\r\n<b>Looking for your next apartment or room? </b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Select the location, move-in date, and the length of time you plan to stay.\r\n\u2022 Filter your search by the type of home (room or apartment) and monthly budget.\r\n\u2022 Once filtered, access the listings that match your needs.\r\n\u2022 Send a chat request to the apartments or rooms that you like the most.\r\n\u2022 When the lister accepts your request, it\u2019s a match and you can chat directly to clarify any doubts and move safely.\r\n\r\nYou can also find us: \r\n<b>Web</b>: www.badi.com\r\n<b>Facebook</b>: https://www.facebook.com/badiapp\r\n<b>Instagram</b>:  https://www.instagram.com/badiapp/\r\n<b>Twitter</b>: https://twitter.com/badi",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the new generation rental app to find flats and rooms all over Europe.  Thanks to its technology, Badi has already connected more than 6M people with flats and rooms. <br><br><b>Do you have an apartment or room to rent out? </b><br><br>\u2022 <b>Publish your listing for free in Badi.</b><br>\u2022 <b>Receive recommended tenants</b> and visit their profiles. <br>\u2022 <b>Talk to interested candidates</b> and find a tenant for your apartment thanks to Badi plus. <br><br><b>Why choose Badi Plus? </b><br><br>\u2022 <b>Unlimited matches</b>: the lister can accept unlimited chat requests from tenants.<br>\u2022 <b>Direct contact with recommended tenants and listing viewers</b>: listers receive tenants\u2019 recommendations based on their preferences<br>\u2022 <b>12-hour boost</b>: your listing visibility is improved for 12hrs.<br><br><b>How to activate Badi Plus*?</b><br><br>1. You can <b>activate Badi Plus</b> by selecting  \u00abGet Badi plus\u00bb in the \u201cstart\u201d section of the app or the website. <br>2. In the next step, you will see the benefits, price and duration of the service (30 days).<br>3. After the payment, <b>Badi Plus</b> will be activated and you can start enjoying it. <br>4. After getting Badi Plus, you will see a countdown so you\u2019ll always know how long you can benefit from Badi Plus<br><br><b>*Badi Plus will be activated for one listing and has a duration of 30 days.</b><br><br><b>Tips and advice</b>: <br><br>\u2022 Making a good first impression is essential when renting a flat or room online. Make sure to upload high-quality and bright photos to convey confidence. We have blog articles that can be of great help to you in the section \u201cHow to use Badi\u201d.<br>\u2022 A complete profile with a bio and detailed description, a quality profile photo, spoken languages \u200b\u200bincreases the chances of finding an apartment or a room to rent.<br>\u2022 Use the app&#39;s filters to refine your search: sort by price, featured, amenities.<br>\u2022If you have questions, write to us at info@badi.com and we will be happy to help you.<br><br><b>Looking for your next apartment or room? </b><br><br>\u2022 Select the location, move-in date, and the length of time you plan to stay.<br>\u2022 Filter your search by the type of home (room or apartment) and monthly budget.<br>\u2022 Once filtered, access the listings that match your needs.<br>\u2022 Send a chat request to the apartments or rooms that you like the most.<br>\u2022 When the lister accepts your request, it\u2019s a match and you can chat directly to clarify any doubts and move safely.<br><br>You can also find us: <br><b>Web</b>: www.badi.com<br><b>Facebook</b>: https://www.facebook.com/badiapp<br><b>Instagram</b>:  https://www.instagram.com/badiapp/<br><b>Twitter</b>: https://twitter.com/badi",
